    "preamble": "S.S. Prakash vs The Commissioner on 4 January, 2024 Author: Battu Devanand Bench: Battu Devanand W. In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 04.01.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice Battu Devanand W.P.No. 26854 of 2017 and W.M.P.No. 28590 of 2017 S.S. Prakash ... Pet Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drugs Administration, 359, Anna Salai, D.M.S. Campus, 5th Floor, Chennai 600 006. 2.The Designated Officer, Food Safety and Drugs Administration, Food Safety Wing, Ddhs Campus, Race Course Road, Trichy 620 020. ... Respo Writ petition is filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of In of a Writ of Certiorari, to call for the records pertaining to the proceedin first respondent bearing Na.Ka.No.9365/2014/ERU1/O.PA.TH.SA dated 09.08.2017 and quash the same. For Petitioner : Mr. P. Ganesan For Respondents : Mr. Vijay Anand, Additional Government Pleader https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/3 S.S. Prakash vs The Commissioner on 4 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/77120902/ 1 W Order",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submits that in view of the subsequent development happened during the pendency of this writ petition, nothing survives in this writ petition and sought to dismiss the writ petition as infructuous."
